{"id": "1-828", "turn": 0, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 2, "seconds": 0.646, "text": "Probably not. At 3578 watts you've got about 9.8 hours, but sunrise isn't until 06:31, 10.3 hours away. Turning off the hot water heat pump would stretch it to about 12.3 hours, still short. The Shark isn't here, so no backup feed tonight. Shall I turn those off?"}
{"id": "1-828", "turn": 1, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 1, "seconds": 0.087, "text": "Sure."}
{"id": "1-2900", "turn": 0, "ok": true, "state_ok": true, "reply_ok": true, "changes": {}, "calls": 2, "seconds": 0.383, "text": "Sofia's in the study, most likely. It's the only room showing anyone apart from yours: the study has shown occupied for about 1 and a half hours."}
